#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:4
msgid "class Histogram -- Histogram Object"
msgstr "class Histogram -- Histogram 对象"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:6
msgid ""
"The histogram object is returned by `Image.get_histogram()`. The underlying "
"class name is ``histogram``."
msgstr "直方图对象由 `Image.get_histogram()` 返回。底层类名为 ``histogram``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:9
msgid ""
"For grayscale images the histogram has a single channel of bins. For RGB565 "
"images the histogram has three channels covering the CIE-LAB ``L``, ``A``, "
"and ``B`` axes. In both cases each channel is normalized so that its bins "
"sum to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"对于灰度图像，直方图具有单一通道的分箱。对于 RGB565 图像，直方图具有三个通道，分别对应 CIE-LAB 的 ``L``\\ 、\\ ``A`` "
"和 ``B`` 轴。在这两种情况下，每个通道都经过归一化，使其分箱总和为 1.0。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:14
msgid ""
"Per-channel bin lists are exposed as both bound methods (``hist.bins()``) "
"and through subscript notation (``hist[0]``). The high-level reductions "
":meth:`get_percentile`, :meth:`get_threshold`, and :meth:`get_statistics` "
"return the corresponding :class:`Percentile <percentile>`, :class:`Threshold"
" <threshold>`, and :class:`Statistics <statistics>` attrtuples."
msgstr ""
"每个通道的分箱列表既以绑定方法（\\ ``hist.bins()``\\ ）形式公开，也可通过下标表示法（\\ ``hist[0]``\\ "
"）访问。高层级的归约方法 :meth:`get_percentile`\\ 、\\ :meth:`get_threshold` 和 "
":meth:`get_statistics` 分别返回对应的 :class:`Percentile <percentile>`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`Threshold <threshold>` 和 :class:`Statistics <statistics>` attrtuple。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:22
msgid ""
"Please call `Image.get_histogram()` to create this object. It has no public "
"constructor."
msgstr "请调用 `Image.get_histogram()` 来创建此对象。它没有公开的构造函数。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:27
msgid ""
"Return the bin list for a grayscale histogram. Each entry is in the range "
"0.0 to 1.0 and the entries sum to 1.0."
msgstr "返回灰度直方图的分箱列表。每个条目的范围为 0.0 到 1.0，且各条目之和为 1.0。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:30
#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:37
msgid "Equivalent to ``histogram[0]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``histogram[0]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:34
msgid ""
"Return the bin list for the LAB ``L`` channel of an RGB565 histogram. Each "
"entry is in the range 0.0 to 1.0 and the entries sum to 1.0."
msgstr "返回 RGB565 直方图中 LAB ``L`` 通道的分箱列表。每个条目的范围为 0.0 到 1.0，且各条目之和为 1.0。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:41
msgid ""
"Return the bin list for the LAB ``A`` channel of an RGB565 histogram. Each "
"entry is in the range 0.0 to 1.0 and the entries sum to 1.0."
msgstr "返回 RGB565 直方图中 LAB ``A`` 通道的分箱列表。每个条目的范围为 0.0 到 1.0，且各条目之和为 1.0。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:44
msgid "Equivalent to ``histogram[1]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``histogram[1]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:48
msgid ""
"Return the bin list for the LAB ``B`` channel of an RGB565 histogram. Each "
"entry is in the range 0.0 to 1.0 and the entries sum to 1.0."
msgstr "返回 RGB565 直方图中 LAB ``B`` 通道的分箱列表。每个条目的范围为 0.0 到 1.0，且各条目之和为 1.0。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:51
msgid "Equivalent to ``histogram[2]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``histogram[2]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:55
msgid ""
"Compute the CDF of every histogram channel and return the bin value at the "
"requested ``percentile`` (a float in ``0.0`` -- ``1.0``)."
msgstr ""
"计算每个直方图通道的 CDF，并返回所请求的 ``percentile``\\ （\\ ``0.0`` -- ``1.0`` "
"范围内的浮点数）处的分箱值。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:58
msgid ""
"Useful for finding the min/max of a color distribution while ignoring "
"outliers (``get_percentile(0.05)`` and ``get_percentile(0.95)`` give a "
"robust min/max)."
msgstr ""
"适用于在忽略离群值的情况下查找颜色分布的最小/最大值（\\ ``get_percentile(0.05)`` 和 "
"``get_percentile(0.95)`` 可给出稳健的最小/最大值）。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:62
msgid "Returns a :class:`Percentile <percentile>` attrtuple."
msgstr "返回一个 :class:`Percentile <percentile>` attrtuple。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:66
msgid ""
"Use Otsu's Method on every channel to find the threshold value that best "
"splits each channel's distribution into a \"background\" and \"foreground\" "
"half. The returned thresholds are well-suited to feed directly into "
"`Image.binary()` or any other method that takes LAB ``L/A/B`` color "
"thresholds."
msgstr ""
"对每个通道使用大津法（Otsu's Method）来找到能最佳地将每个通道的分布划分为“背景”和“前景”两半的阈值。返回的阈值非常适合直接传入 "
"`Image.binary()` 或任何其他接受 LAB ``L/A/B`` 颜色阈值的方法。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:72
msgid "Returns a :class:`Threshold <threshold>` attrtuple."
msgstr "返回一个 :class:`Threshold <threshold>` attrtuple。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:76
msgid ""
"Compute the mean, median, mode, standard deviation, min, max, lower "
"quartile, and upper quartile of every histogram channel."
msgstr "计算每个直方图通道的均值、中位数、众数、标准差、最小值、最大值、下四分位数和上四分位数。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:79
msgid "Returns a :class:`Statistics <statistics>` attrtuple."
msgstr "返回一个 :class:`Statistics <statistics>` attrtuple。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:83
#: ../../library/omv.image.Histogram.rst:87
msgid "Alias for :meth:`get_statistics`."
msgstr ":meth:`get_statistics` 的别名。"
